                <p rendition="#flush">I. <hi rendition="#italic">Peace Treaty With Italy</hi></p>
                <p>The Deputies proceeded, on the instructions of the Ministers, to discuss the
                    following agenda: <list>
                        <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>)</label>
                        <item>Text of Article 16 (Free Territory of Trieste)</item>
                        <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>)</label>
                        <item>List of questions still outstanding in the draft treaty.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <list>
                    <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>)</label>
                    <item><hi rendition="#italic">Article 16</hi>.</item>
                    <label/>
                    <item>An exchange of views took place on the text of this Article to be
                        submitted for the consideration of the Ministers. Alternative texts
                        submitted by the U.S.S.R. Delegation (Annex 1) and by the French United
                        States, and United Kingdom Delegations (Annex 2) are annexed for information
                        to the present Record.<anchor n="92" xml:id="d351-f1"/></item>
                    <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>)</label>
                    <item><hi rendition="#italic">List of Outstanding Questions</hi>.</item>
                    <label/>
                    <item>The annex list of Articles or questions still outstanding on the Italian
                        Treaty was <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> (Annex 3).</item>
                </list>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting</hi></p>
                <p>Monday, November 25, 1946, at 11 a.m.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1946-11-26">November 26,
                            1946</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>



